---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /tags/
title: Etiquetas
description: Índice de todas as etiquetas usadas nos artigos do GPTCLONE Blog.
navKey: blog
---
{% set tags = collections.articles | tagCounts %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>Arquivo</p>
    <div class="page-hero-grid">
      <h1 class="page-title">Etiquetas</h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Um índice dos temas tratados no blog. Cada etiqueta reúne os artigos que a utilizam.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="page-meta">{{ tags.length }} etiquetas em {{ collections.articles.length }} artigos</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <ul class="tag-list tag-list-lg">
      {% for tag in tags %}
      <li>
        <a class="tag" href="{{ ('/tags/' ~ (tag.name | slug) ~ '/') | url }}">
          {{ tag.name }} <span class="tag-count">{{ tag.count }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
